# Common constraints

## Dependencies

- Do not re-list the stack here — see **Stack** in `AGENTS.md` (source of truth).
- Stick to that stack; do not add dependencies or change paradigms (e.g. async) unless the user asks or `ROADMAP.md` has reached that work.

## Config & env

- Load settings via pydantic-settings.
- Never hardcode environment values in app or test code.
- Test env defaults live in `pyproject.toml` `[tool.pytest.ini_options].env` (not conftest, not hardcoded in tests).
- Do not commit `.env`; keep `.env.example` in sync when keys change.

## Scope

- Follow `ROADMAP.md` and explicit user requests.
- Do not implement features ahead of the roadmap checklist or invent unrequested work.
